                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7bc6c3b5-c77d-3c55-932c-ed29fa30cbef",
                        "entry_id": "e2addd58-29e3-36a4-8d4f-f97ba1e2b359",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A woman who has an unfaithful husband."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "099fd83d-775e-4f97-8dab-edfb814d5ebd",
                                "sense_id": "7bc6c3b5-c77d-3c55-932c-ed29fa30cbef",
                                "text": "Ye make hir a cookqueane."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76a0b4e6-78fa-47e7-87c3-d5790d8c2b6e",
                                "sense_id": "7bc6c3b5-c77d-3c55-932c-ed29fa30cbef",
                                "text": "Yes, that's her name! His cuckquean she is; his wife she is not and never shall be!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "474d9f05-bc3f-4449-b4be-c1cfe973f6d9",
                                "sense_id": "7bc6c3b5-c77d-3c55-932c-ed29fa30cbef",
                                "text": "A formidable woman of real power and prestige, she emerged from the Monica affair much more cuckold than cuckquean. Her husband’s perfidy did, in a sense, disturb the natural order of things; in the post-feminist age, ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "52aec6dd-6773-4ed3-bffd-b6de2c932450",
                                "sense_id": "7bc6c3b5-c77d-3c55-932c-ed29fa30cbef",
                                "text": "The rumors about his serial philandering had been out there for years, but a friendly liberal press had not tried very hard to confirm the allegations, and the missus was apparently resigned to the role of a stoic cuckquean."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f64d6486-3964-3f48-889e-6ee438a1ee9e",
                        "entry_id": "e2addd58-29e3-36a4-8d4f-f97ba1e2b359",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A woman who is attracted to or aroused by the sexual infidelity of a partner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
